{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b6f2a6b0-6e6a-4b6e-9c1a-campusrate001",
    "name": "CampusRate - Scénarios de tests manuels",
    "description": "Collection de 10 scénarios représentatifs couvrant les exigences de la section 9 du TP1 CampusRate : création/consultation des deux ressources, modification, suppression permise, note invalide, ressource inexistante, conflit de suppression, filtre, pagination, erreur Problem Details et persistance après redémarrage.\n\nÀ exécuter dans l'ordre (dossier 1 à 10), le serveur NestJS devant tourner localement sur le port 3000 (`npm run start:dev`). Les ids créés sont capturés automatiquement dans des variables de collection et réutilisés par les requêtes suivantes.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3000/v1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "locationId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "appreciationId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "persistenceLocationId", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Créer et consulter un endroit",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Créer un endroit",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Statut 201 Created\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"En-tête Location présent\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.header(\"Location\");",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"locationId\", jsonData.id);",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"La location créée a un id, averageRating null et reviewCount à 0\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.id).to.be.a(\"string\");",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.averageRating).to.equal(null);",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.reviewCount).to.equal(0);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" } ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Bibliothèque principale\",\n  \"description\": \"Espace calme avec prises.\",\n  \"category\": \"STUDY_SPACE\",\n  \"address\": \"Pavillon A, local A-210\",\n  \"services\": [\"WIFI\", \"POWER_OUTLETS\"],\n  \"status\": \"ACTIVE\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/locations", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["locations"] },
            "description": "Vérifie : création d'un endroit, code 201, en-tête Location, averageRating null / reviewCount 0 par défaut."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Consulter l'endroit créé",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Statut 200 OK\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test(\"L'id retourné correspond à celui créé\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.id).to.equal(pm.collectionVariables.get(\"locationId\"));",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/locations/{{locationId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["locations", "{{locationId}}"] },
            "description": "Vérifie : consultation d'un endroit par son id, code 200."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Créer et consulter une appréciation",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Créer une appréciation",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Statut 201 Created\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"En-tête Location présent\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.header(\"Location\");",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"appreciationId\", jsonData.id);",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"L'appréciation référence bien le bon placeId\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.placeId).to.equal(pm.collectionVariables.get(\"locationId\"));",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" } ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"placeId\": \"{{locationId}}\",\n  \"authorName\": \"Samira\",\n  \"rating\": 4,\n  \"comment\": \"Calme et Wi-Fi stable.\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/appreciations", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["appreciations"] },
            "description": "Vérifie : création d'une appréciation liée à un endroit existant, code 201, en-tête Location."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Consulter l'appréciation créée",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Statut 200 OK\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/appreciations/{{appreciationId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["appreciations", "{{appreciationId}}"] },
            "description": "Vérifie : consultation d'une appréciation par son id, code 200."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Vérifier le recalcul des statistiques de l'endroit",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Consulter l'endroit après l'ajout de l'appréciation",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"averageRating et reviewCount reflètent l'appréciation créée\", function () {",
                  "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.reviewCount).to.equal(1);",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.averageRating).to.equal(4);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/locations/{{locationId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["locations", "{{locationId}}"] },
            "description": "Vérifie : averageRating et reviewCount sont recalculés automatiquement après la création d'une appréciation."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Modifier un endroit",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Modifier partiellement l'endroit",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Statut 200 OK\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Le statut a bien été modifié\", function () {",
                  "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.status).to.equal(\"TEMPORARILY_CLOSED\");",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" } ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"TEMPORARILY_CLOSED\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/locations/{{locationId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["locations", "{{locationId}}"] },
            "description": "Vérifie : modification partielle (PATCH) d'un endroit, code 200."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "5. Filtrer et paginer la collection",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Lister les endroits filtrés et paginés",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Statut 200 OK\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"La réponse a la forme { data, pagination }\", function () {",
                  "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property(\"data\");",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property(\"pagination\");",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.pagination).to.have.property(\"page\");",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.pagination).to.have.property(\"limit\");",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.pagination).to.have.property(\"totalItems\");",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.pagination).to.have.property(\"totalPages\");",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/locations?category=STUDY_SPACE&page=1&limit=5",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["locations"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "category", "value": "STUDY_SPACE" },
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "5" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Vérifie : filtre par catégorie et pagination combinés, format de réponse { data, pagination }."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "6. Note invalide",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Créer une appréciation avec une note hors bornes (10)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Statut 400 Bad Request\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(400);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Réponse au format Problem Details\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get(\"Content-Type\")).to.include(\"application/problem+json\");",
                  "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property(\"type\");",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property(\"title\");",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.status).to.equal(400);",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property(\"detail\");",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property(\"instance\");",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" } ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"placeId\": \"{{locationId}}\",\n  \"authorName\": \"Test\",\n  \"rating\": 10,\n  \"comment\": \"Note invalide\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/appreciations", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["appreciations"] },
            "description": "Vérifie : validation métier (rating doit être entre 1 et 5), code 400 au format Problem Details."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "7. Ressource inexistante",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Consulter un endroit avec un id inexistant",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Statut 404 Not Found\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(404);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Réponse au format Problem Details\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get(\"Content-Type\")).to.include(\"application/problem+json\");",
                  "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.status).to.equal(404);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/locations/loc_00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["locations", "loc_00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"] },
            "description": "Vérifie : ressource inexistante, code 404 au format Problem Details."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "8. Conflit de suppression",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Tenter de supprimer un endroit qui a encore une appréciation",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Statut 409 Conflict\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(409);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Réponse au format Problem Details\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get(\"Content-Type\")).to.include(\"application/problem+json\");",
                  "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.status).to.equal(409);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/locations/{{locationId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["locations", "{{locationId}}"] },
            "description": "Vérifie : refus de suppression d'un endroit qui a encore des appréciations, code 409 au format Problem Details. (L'appréciation créée au scénario 2 existe encore à ce stade.)"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "9. Suppression permise",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Supprimer l'appréciation",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Statut 204 No Content\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(204);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/appreciations/{{appreciationId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["appreciations", "{{appreciationId}}"] },
            "description": "Retire l'appréciation, ce qui doit permettre la suppression de l'endroit juste après."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Supprimer l'endroit (maintenant permis)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Statut 204 No Content\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(204);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/locations/{{locationId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["locations", "{{locationId}}"] },
            "description": "Vérifie : suppression permise une fois qu'il n'y a plus d'appréciation associée, code 204 sans corps."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "10. Persistance après redémarrage",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Créer une location témoin (avant redémarrage)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Statut 201 Created\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"persistenceLocationId\", jsonData.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" } ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Local témoin - test de persistance\",\n  \"description\": \"Créé pour vérifier que les données survivent à un redémarrage du serveur.\",\n  \"category\": \"OTHER\",\n  \"address\": \"N/A\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/locations", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["locations"] },
            "description": "IMPORTANT : après avoir exécuté cette requête, arrête le serveur (Ctrl+C dans le terminal) puis relance-le (npm run start:dev) AVANT d'exécuter la requête suivante de ce dossier."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Vérifier que la location existe toujours après redémarrage",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"La location créée avant redémarrage existe toujours\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.id).to.equal(pm.collectionVariables.get(\"persistenceLocationId\"));",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/locations/{{persistenceLocationId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["locations", "{{persistenceLocationId}}"] },
            "description": "À exécuter seulement APRÈS avoir redémarré le serveur suite à la requête précédente. Confirme que location.json a bien persisté sur disque entre les deux exécutions."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
